psalm.text:
[[Ps 109,21]]Do you, O GOD, my Lord, deal kindly with me for your name’s sake;
in your generous mercy rescue me;
[[Ps 109,22]]For I am wretched and poor,
and my heart is pierced within me.

[[Ps 109,26]]Help me, O LORD, my God;
save me, in your mercy,
[[Ps 109,27]]And let them know that this is your hand;
that you, O LORD, have done this.

[[Ps 109,30]]I will speak my thanks earnestly to the LORD,
and in the midst of the throng I will praise him,
[[Ps 109,31]]For he stood at the right hand of the poor man,
to save him from those who would condemn his soul.
